claim.claim-text:
(a) adding an organic solvent to the free base of the compound of Formula (I) to form an admixture;
(b) adding 2 to 3 equivalents of methanesulfonic acid to each equivalent of Formula (I) free base in the admixture obtained in step (a) to form a slurry containing solid Formula (I) crystalline bis-methanesulfonate salt; and
(c) isolating the solid Formula (I) crystalline bis-methanesulfonate salt from the slurry.
